      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present 2B Rathborne Way, a beautifully presented two bedroom, two-bathroom ground floor apartment in this well maintained development in the heart of Ashtown, Dublin 15. Rathbourne Way is ideally situated within a vibrant and well-connected community and is hard to beat, with Ashtown, Castleknock Village, and Blanchardstown Shopping Centre all close by. The Phoenix Park is only minutes away, along with a great selection of schools and local amenities. The Ashtown train station is only a short stroll that offers easy links to the LUAS and DART, while a frequent bus service runs right outside the building. The M50 and Dublin Airport are also within easy reach, making this a very convenient place to live.\r\n\r\n \r\nBright and spacious living accommodation extending to approximately 75 sq. m comprises an inviting entrance hallway leading into a bright dual-aspect open-plan living and dining area, which benefits from balconies to both the front and rear. A separate fully fitted kitchen is located just off the living space, offering a practical and well-designed layout. The apartment boasts two generously proportioned double bedrooms, both featuring built-in wardrobes for ample storage. The principal bedroom benefits from a stylish en-suite, while a well-appointed family bathroom completes the accommodation. The property is further enhanced by a designated parking space to the front.\r\n\r\nNo. 2B comes to the market in Turn Key condition throughout and further benefits with designated parking, sunny front and rear balconies electric storage heaters, easy transport links. Based on recent success in the Ashtown area, we know this property will be very popular so contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers at your earliest convenience to register your interest.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n•2 BED / 2 BATH Ground Floor Apartment\r\n•Dual aspect living space\r\n•2 Balconies both receiving sunshine\r\n•No Onward Chain!\r\n•Designated Parking to the front\r\n•Electric Storage Heaters\r\n•Built in 2003\r\n•Management fees c. 2,200 p/a\r\n•Ashtown Train station only a short stroll away\r\n•120 bus route right outside the building\r\n•Castleknock Village & Blanchardstown Shopping centre only a short drive\r\n•Enquire NOW so you don't miss out!\r\n\r\nDirections: \r\nEircode = D15 RDN4"
      },
      {
